0000:                   ** If Network I/O ptrs are disabled, F$Fork runs 72 cycles faster
0000:                   Network  equ    0             Set to 1 to enable network I/O ptrs
0000:                   
0000:                            IFP1
0000:                            use    defsfile
0000:                            use    cocovtio.d
0000:                            ENDC
