010C:                   **************************************************
010C:                   * System Call: F$CRCMod
010C:                   *
010C:                   * Function: Changes CRC module reporting
010C:                   *
010C:                   * Input:  A = Flag (0 = report, 1 = CRC off, 2 = CRC on)
010C:                   *
010C:                   * Output: A = State (0 = CRC off, 1 = CRC on)
010C:                   *
010C:                   * Error:  CC = C bit set; B = error code
010C:                   *
010C: A641              FCRCMod  lda    R$A,u       do they want a report or a toggle?
010E: 2708                       beq    CRCRep      a report only
0110: 4A                         deca               check for OFF
0111: 2601                       bne    GoCRCon     no, must be on
0113: 8C                         fcb   $8C          skip 2 bytes, saves 3 bytes of memory
0114: 8601              GoCRCon  lda    #$1         CRC checking on
0116: 973B                       sta    <D.CRC      turn CRC checking on
0118: 963B              CRCRep   lda    <D.CRC      get current CRC flag for return
011A: A741              CRCRep2  sta    R$A,u       save it to their register stack
011C: 5F                         clrb               no error
011D: 39                         rts                and exit
